，頻次不代表來源權威度。","included_kinds":["paragraph","table_cell"],"identity_policy":"contextual_provisional","ties":"all_maxima","frequency_is_not_authority":true},"kinship_interpretation_cases":[],"source_reading_cases":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:source_review1-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","source_quote":"　　蔡約字景撝，濟陽考城人也。祖廓，宋祠部尚書。父興宗，征西、儀同。","reading":"蔡約字景撝，居濟陽考城。祖蔡廓官祠部尚書；父蔡興宗官征西、儀同。","note":"蔡約字景撝，居濟陽考城。祖蔡廓官祠部尚書；父蔡興宗官征西、儀同。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":34,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:source_review2-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","source_quote":"　　約少尚宋孝武女安吉公主，拜駙馬都尉，祕書郎，不拜。從帝車騎驃騎行參軍，通直郎，不就。遷太祖司空東閤祭酒，太尉主簿。齊臺建，爲世子中舍人，仍隨度東宮。轉鄱陽王友，竟陵王鎮北征北諮議，領記室，中書郎，司徒右長史，黃門郎，領本州中正。出爲新安太守，復爲黃門郎，領射聲校尉，通直常侍，領驍騎將軍，太子中庶子，領屯騎校尉。永明八年八月合朔，約脫武冠，解劔，於省眠，至下鼓不起，爲有司所奏，贖論。太孫立，領校尉如故。","reading":"少尚宋孝武女安吉公主，與梁同號公主分屬。出入劉宋與齊臺；永明八年八月合朔在省而諸鼓不起，原係政務案件。","note":"少尚宋孝武女安吉公主，與梁同號公主分屬。出入劉宋與齊臺；永明八年八月合朔在省而諸鼓不起，原係政務案件。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p002","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":204,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:source_review3-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","source_quote":"　　出爲宜都王冠軍長史、淮南太守，行府州事。世祖謂約曰：「今用卿爲近蕃上佐，想副我所期。」約曰：「南豫密邇京師，不治自理。臣亦何人，爝火不息。」時諸王行事多相裁割，約在任，主佐之間穆如也。","reading":"出佐宜都王，兼淮南太守。世祖與蔡約對語，軍政行事和王府禮法共載。","note":"出佐宜都王，兼淮南太守。世祖與蔡約對語，軍政行事和王府禮法共載。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p003","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":94,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:source_review4-0","kind":"source_review","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","source_quote":"　　遷司徒左長史。高宗爲錄尚書輔政，百僚屣履到席，約躡屐不改。帝謂江祏曰：「蔡氏故是禮度之門，故自可悅。」祏曰：「大將軍有揖客，復見於今。」建武元年，遷侍中。明年，遷西陽王撫軍長史，加冠軍將軍，徙廬陵王右軍長史，將軍如故。轉都官尚書，遷邵陵王師，加給事中，江夏王車騎長史，加征虜將軍，竝不拜。好飲酒，夷淡不與世雜。遷太子詹事。永元二年，卒。年四十四。贈太常。","reading":"高宗輔政，蔡約着屐，江祏稱揖客。建武元年及次年各有升遷。固定數位為永元二年卒，年四十四。殿本和四庫本作永明二年，與同段在建武任官的次序不合，保留兩本原字。","note":"高宗輔政，蔡約着屐，江祏稱揖客。建武元年及次年各有升遷。固定數位為永元二年卒，年四十四。殿本和四庫本作永明二年，與同段在建武任官的次序不合，保留兩本原字。","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p004","start_codepoint":0,"end_codepoint":179,"human_reviewed":false,"chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897"}],"reported_variants":[],"family_tree_decisions":[],"preferred_relations":[{"id":"a-qi046-caiyue-grandfather","subject_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","object_person_id":"0f0_5a2_b64","predicate":"grandfather","qualifiers":{"source_term":"祖廓","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-046","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001","quote":"　　蔡約字景撝，濟陽考城人也。祖廓，宋祠部尚書。父興宗，征西、儀同。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0016"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"據本傳原句。宋安吉公主依朝代、父與夫同核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-qi046-caiyue-father","subject_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","object_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw","predicate":"father","qualifiers":{"source_term":"父興宗","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-046","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001","quote":"　　蔡約字景撝，濟陽考城人也。祖廓，宋祠部尚書。父興宗，征西、儀同。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0025"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"據本傳原句。宋安吉公主依朝代、父與夫同核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-qi046-caiyue-marriage","subject_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","object_person_id":"sx5_u87_kik","predicate":"spouse","qualifiers":{"source_term":"約少尚宋孝武女安吉公主"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-046","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p002","quote":"　　約少尚宋孝武女安吉公主，拜駙馬都尉，祕書郎，不拜。從帝車騎驃騎行參軍，通直郎，不就。遷太祖司空東閤祭酒，太尉主簿。齊臺建，爲世子中舍人，仍隨度東宮。轉鄱陽王友，竟陵王鎮北征北諮議，領記室，中書郎，司徒右長史，黃門郎，領本州中正。出爲新安太守，復爲黃門郎，領射聲校尉，通直常侍，領驍騎將軍，太子中庶子，領屯騎校尉。永明八年八月合朔，約脫武冠，解劔，於省眠，至下鼓不起，爲有司所奏，贖論。太孫立，領校尉如故。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p002:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p002:m0009"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"據本傳原句。宋安吉公主依朝代、父與夫同核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false},{"id":"a-nanshi022-wangci-128-78","subject_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","object_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw","predicate":"father","status":"source_attested","qualifiers":{"source_term":"蔡興宗子約","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangci-ws1477957","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002","quote":"少與從弟儉共書學。謝鳳子超宗嘗候僧虔，仍往東齋詣慈。慈正學書，未即放筆，超宗曰：「卿書何如虔公？」慈曰：「慈書比大人，如雞之比鳳。」超宗狼狽而退。十歲時，與蔡興宗子約入寺禮佛，正遇沙門懺，約戲慈曰：「眾僧今日可謂虔虔。」慈應聲曰：「卿如此，何以興蔡氏之宗。」歷位吳郡太守，大司馬長史，侍中，領步兵校尉，司徒左長史。慈患腳，齊武帝敕王晏：「慈有微疾，不能騎，聽乘車在仗後。」江左以來少例也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002:m0082","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002:m0078","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002","start":78,"end":83,"surface":"蔡興宗子約"}}],"interpretation_note":"依原句的親屬詞、人物位置及同卷前後文。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[{"connection":"father","parent_person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw","generation_distance":1,"source_assertion_id":"a-nanshi022-wangci-128-78","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanshi","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangci-ws1477957","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002","quote":"少與從弟儉共書學。謝鳳子超宗嘗候僧虔，仍往東齋詣慈。慈正學書，未即放筆，超宗曰：「卿書何如虔公？」慈曰：「慈書比大人，如雞之比鳳。」超宗狼狽而退。十歲時，與蔡興宗子約入寺禮佛，正遇沙門懺，約戲慈曰：「眾僧今日可謂虔虔。」慈應聲曰：「卿如此，何以興蔡氏之宗。」歷位吳郡太守，大司馬長史，侍中，領步兵校尉，司徒左長史。慈患腳，齊武帝敕王晏：「慈有微疾，不能騎，聽乘車在仗後。」江左以來少例也。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002:m0082","object_person_mention_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002:m0078","relationship_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002","start":78,"end":83,"surface":"蔡興宗子約"},"source_term":"蔡興宗子約"}],"status":"contextual_provisional","human_reviewed":false,"interpretation_note":"原句父子／父女。","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A"}],"life_events":[{"id":"le-qi046-caiyue-death","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","event_type":"death","source_term":"卒","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p004","start":168,"end":169,"surface":"卒"},"date_expression":"永元二年","evidence":[{"work_id":"w-nanqishu","book_id":"b-nanqishu-046","chapter_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete","source_id":"s-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete-ws1511897","paragraph_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p004","quote":"　　遷司徒左長史。高宗爲錄尚書輔政，百僚屣履到席，約躡屐不改。帝謂江祏曰：「蔡氏故是禮度之門，故自可悅。」祏曰：「大將軍有揖客，復見於今。」建武元年，遷侍中。明年，遷西陽王撫軍長史，加冠軍將軍，徙廬陵王右軍長史，將軍如故。轉都官尚書，遷邵陵王師，加給事中，江夏王車騎長史，加征虜將軍，竝不拜。好飲酒，夷淡不與世雜。遷太子詹事。永元二年，卒。年四十四。贈太常。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p004:m0025"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"age_assertions":[{"id":"age-qi046-caiyue-death","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","source_number":"四十四","source_term":"年四十四","value":44,"unit":"source_age_years","counting":"unspecified_source_age","birth_