aiyue-complete:p004","quote":"　　遷司徒左長史。高宗爲錄尚書輔政，百僚屣履到席，約躡屐不改。帝謂江祏曰：「蔡氏故是禮度之門，故自可悅。」祏曰：「大將軍有揖客，復見於今。」建武元年，遷侍中。明年，遷西陽王撫軍長史，加冠軍將軍，徙廬陵王右軍長史，將軍如故。轉都官尚書，遷邵陵王師，加給事中，江夏王車騎長史，加征虜將軍，竝不拜。好飲酒，夷淡不與世雜。遷太子詹事。永元二年，卒。年四十四。贈太常。","person_mention_id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p004:m0025"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"所見原官稱，未載全任期。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"address_assertions":[],"person_references":[{"start":116,"end":117,"surface":"卿","id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002:r0116","paragraph_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci:p002","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","referent_role":"addressee","quote":"少與從弟儉共書學。謝鳳子超宗嘗候僧虔，仍往東齋詣慈。慈正學書，未即放筆，超宗曰：「卿書何如虔公？」慈曰：「慈書比大人，如雞之比鳳。」超宗狼狽而退。十歲時，與蔡興宗子約入寺禮佛，正遇沙門懺，約戲慈曰：「眾僧今日可謂虔虔。」慈應聲曰：「卿如此，何以興蔡氏之宗。」歷位吳郡太守，大司馬長史，侍中，領步兵校尉，司徒左長史。慈患腳，齊武帝敕王晏：「慈有微疾，不能騎，聽乘車在仗後。」江左以來少例也。","note":"本句按敘述視點回指約。","chapter_id":"c-nanshi-022-wangci","book_id":"b-nanshi-022","work_id":"w-nanshi","source_id":"s-nanshi-022-wangci-ws1477957"}],"table_occurrences":[],"date_normalizations":[],"birth_order_constraints":[],"preferred_birth_order_constraints":[],"identity_decisions":[],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001","text":"　　蔡約字景撝，濟陽考城人也。祖廓，宋祠部尚書。父興宗，征西、儀同。","text_layer":"received_chapter","annotation_status":"reviewed","source_position":{"first_line":35,"last_line":35,"raw_start":2666,"raw_end":2700,"raw_character_offsets":[2666,2667,2668,2669,2670,2671,2672,2673,2674,2675,2676,2677,2678,2679,2680,2681,2682,2683,2684,2685,2686,2687,2688,2689,2690,2691,2692,2693,2694,2695,2696,2697,2698,2699],"revision_id":1511897},"mentions":[{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"蔡約","kind":"person","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0005","start":5,"end":7,"surface":"景撝","kind":"person","person_id":"fcu_pw8_tkw_A","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-nanqishu-046-caiyue-complete:p001:m0016","start":